1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,160
It's you !

25
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,840
Fellow cultivators, stop !

26
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:22,960
Explode !

27
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,040
Today,

28
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,720
you won't escape me !

29
00:02:35,810 --> 00:02:37,240
Red Butterfly's cultivation is too high

30
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,830
and she displays such a strong killing intent.

31
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,200
If I want to survive

32
00:02:41,950 --> 00:02:43,150
I must also attack.

33
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:45,200
Wang Lin's\NRestriction Spear

34
00:02:48,090 --> 00:02:49,760
Ceng Niu's is Early stage Soul Formation,

35
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,240
how can he display such strength !?

36
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,320
Red Butterfly,

37
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,680
you didn't send your parents off.

38
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,720
You are unfilial !

39
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,960
He actually knows how to break her Dao Heart,

40
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,160
that's unexpected.

41
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,440
For one selfish desire,

42
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,000
you destroyed the Four Sect Alliance.

43
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,240
You are heartless !

44
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,200
You...

45
00:03:16,010 --> 00:03:18,400
You tried to kill me without any reason.

46
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,760
That is unjust !

47
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,280
Xue Yue still exists

48
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,550
yet you sold yourself to Suzaku.

49
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,360
You are unfaithful !

50
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,960
You are unfilial, unjust, and unfaithful !

51
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,040
What kind of Dao are you cultivating ?!

52
00:04:18,210 --> 00:04:20,080
Even when all the stars align,

53
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:22,720
I still can't even touch her.

54
00:04:23,050 --> 00:04:24,280
You are the first one

55
00:04:24,450 --> 00:04:26,600
who forced me to use my life artifact.

56
00:04:26,930 --> 00:04:28,520
You can rest in peace now !

57
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:29,720
Stop !

58
00:04:29,850 --> 00:04:30,640
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

59
00:04:30,650 --> 00:04:31,200
Brother Ceng,

60
00:04:31,850 --> 00:04:33,800
I was the one who invited you here.

61
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,240
If you both continue,

62
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:37,160
then don't blame me for being ruthless !

63
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:39,280
Fellow cultivator Chi Hu,

64
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,280
I'm not the one who started all this.

65
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,120
This has nothing to do with you.

66
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,080
Back down !

67
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:47,400
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

68
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,880
both of you are my guests.

69
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,640
If you insist on continuing to attack,

70
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,400
then that means you’re hostile towards me !

71
00:04:54,650 --> 00:04:57,080
I will stand with Brother Ceng and fight back.

72
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:58,880
And if I make it back alive,

73
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:59,520
Chi Hu's\NOrigin Soul

74
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:02,040
I’ll definitely report this to Xi Zu !

75
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:03,400
Divine Retribution !

76
00:05:18,090 --> 00:05:18,560
Okay.

77
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,160
Chi Hu,

78
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,760
for the sake of our relation,

79
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:23,520
I won’t kill this person today.

80
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,640
But the celestial jade coffin

81
00:05:24,890 --> 00:05:25,760
must be mine.

82
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,360
Red Butterfly,

83
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,360
do you really think

84
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,280
that I can't kill you ?

85
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:36,240
I only need to send out this restriction in my hand

86
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:38,440
and this fragment will collapse.

87
00:05:38,610 --> 00:05:40,160
Do you believe me ?

88
00:05:44,050 --> 00:05:44,680
Brother Ceng,

89
00:05:45,210 --> 00:05:46,680
I’ll make the decision.

90
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,840
Everything we obtain

91
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,560
will be split equally between us.

92
00:05:49,730 --> 00:05:50,360
How is that ?

93
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:55,600
Good,

94
00:05:56,290 --> 00:05:58,320
I leave it to Brother Chi Hu then.

95
00:06:01,090 --> 00:06:01,920
Ceng Niu,

96
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,000
when we return to planet Suzaku,

97
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:06,080
do you dare to fight me ?

98
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:07,400
I'm willing.

99
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:19,240
Ting'er,

100
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:20,520
look,

101
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,400
Ting'er

102
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:22,640
we are home.

103
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,240
It has been 1000 years

104
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:32,160
and you are still so beautiful.

105
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,360
Your body was preserved

106
00:06:34,690 --> 00:06:36,480
thanks to the celestial jades I gathered.

107
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:38,360
You kept your beautiful appearance.

108
00:06:39,450 --> 00:06:40,880
I will definitely find

109
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:43,360
more celestial jades for you.

110
00:06:44,290 --> 00:06:46,680
People say I'm a crazy, disgusting,

111
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,520
corpse-loving maniac.

112
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:50,920
They don't understand

113
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:54,000
that it is fate that I met you in the Celestial Realm.

114
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:56,570
Who cares if they say I'm crazy.

115
00:06:56,610 --> 00:06:58,640
I don't regret it.

116
00:07:00,090 --> 00:07:00,920
Don't be afraid.

117
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:03,920
Your husband will always protect you.

118
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:07,910
will die.

119
00:07:04,650 --> 00:07:06,000
Anyone that opposes us,

120
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:08,530
Celestial Jade Pagoda

121
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,160
Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly's ice sculpture really is amazing,

122
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,240
I admire you.

123
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,240
This fragment

124
00:07:26,330 --> 00:07:28,560
is the coldest of the Celestial Realm.

125
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:28,760
Central Cold Fragment\NRain Celestial Realm

126
00:07:28,690 --> 00:07:29,960
Without fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,

127
00:07:30,250 --> 00:07:32,560
we couldn't have crossed those lands of ice.

128
00:07:34,210 --> 00:07:35,720
Even if it is beyond this obstacle,

129
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:37,960
why hasn't anyone else

130
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,520
found the location in the jade ?

131
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:42,710
To tell you the truth,

132
00:07:42,770 --> 00:07:44,360
the reason I'm so confident

133
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:47,860
is because that fragment cannot be accessed through the vortex.

134
00:07:48,570 --> 00:07:50,920
It's a very rare case of fragments overlapping.

135
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:53,080
Even teleportation formations are useless there.

136
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:57,160
How did Xi Zu find it back then ?

137
00:07:58,010 --> 00:08:00,200
This involves my clan's secrets,

138
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:02,280
I can’t tell you.

139
00:08:04,810 --> 00:08:06,520
After traversing this cold fragment,

140
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,880
we will have to go through the void.

141
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,120
After the void,

142
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,880
we will reach the overlapping fragment.

143
00:08:22,690 --> 00:08:23,840
I have done my job,

144
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,040
this is the end of the fragment.

145
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:26,640
My spiritual energy has ran out.

146
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:27,920
From now on,

147
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,920
I won't act anymore.

148
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,480
Don't worry fellow cultivator,

149
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,920
you can count on us now.

150
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,710
You have spent a lot of spiritual energy these past 3 days

151
00:08:36,730 --> 00:08:38,080
so you should get some rest.

152
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,920
Even if she ran out of spiritual energy,

153
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,320
she can just take a pill to recover it.

154
00:08:43,850 --> 00:08:46,000
She clearly is luring me into attacking her.

155
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,760
If I could reach Middle stage Soul Formation,

156
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,840
my domain would evolve

157
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,760
and I would be able to defeat her.

158
00:08:54,290 --> 00:08:55,920
100 years to Soul Formation,

159
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,400
she might be a genius

160
00:08:57,970 --> 00:09:00,120
but her cultivation must be unstable.

161
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:04,800
The Giant Demon Clan's treasure,

162
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,040
the star compass ?

163
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:10,600
Fake Star Compass

164
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,040
In Tu Si's memory,

165
00:09:09,330 --> 00:09:11,320
I have the method to craft such a star compass.

166
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,280
It's a pity most of the materials are extinct

167
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,640
so it's almost impossible to use.

168
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,400
If it were a real star compass,

169
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:22,320
I would not be able to control it with my cultivation.

170
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:25,080
This one is just an imitation

171
00:09:25,570 --> 00:09:28,480
so it's not as effective as a real one.

172
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,000
Red Butterfly,

173
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:33,400
please go to the west side of the compass, under the defensive barrier.

174
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,360
That way you can safely recover your spiritual energy.

175
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,760
I promise you that

176
00:09:38,050 --> 00:09:39,240
nothing will bother you

177
00:09:39,450 --> 00:09:40,840
during this trip through the void.

178
00:09:45,170 --> 00:09:45,960
Brother Ceng,

179
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,560
I need you to control the eastern side.

180
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,800
In this void,

181
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,680
there are many unknown entities.

182
00:09:53,170 --> 00:09:55,560
You need to use those souls of yours to scout

183
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:57,040
and if you encounter anything,

184
00:09:57,210 --> 00:09:59,000
tell me so I can avoid it.

185
00:09:59,170 --> 00:10:00,080
In this void,

186
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:02,400
you must not spread your Divine Sense

187
00:10:02,610 --> 00:10:05,040
because doing so will bring about disaster.

188
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:06,840
This is something

189
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,960
Ancestor Xi Zu told me.

190
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,360
Brother Chi Hu,

191
00:10:18,250 --> 00:10:19,480
this compass

192
00:10:19,610 --> 00:10:21,250
is meant to be operated

193
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,080
by at least 5 people.

194
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:25,640
Correct !

195
00:10:25,850 --> 00:10:27,320
But there aren't enough treasures

196
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,960
to divide between 5 people.

197
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,360
Brother Ceng,

198
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:31,720
if this compass

199
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,200
breaks in the void,

200
00:10:33,530 --> 00:10:35,200
none of us will survive.

201
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,720
I must focus all of my attention on controlling the compass

202
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:41,320
so it will all depend on Brother Ceng.

203
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:56,120
Void\NRain Celestial Realm

204
00:10:58,450 --> 00:11:00,920
There's something 10 li ahead.

205
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,480
Hurry up ! Let's go !

206
00:11:38,450 --> 00:11:40,200
Thank you Brother Ceng for the early warning.

207
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,320
Without you,

208
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,560
the three of us

209
00:11:42,770 --> 00:11:44,520
would have died there.

210
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:45,960
What kind of beast was that ?

211
00:11:46,770 --> 00:11:47,880
I have no idea

212
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,870
but something that can live inside the void of the Celestial Realm

213
00:11:50,890 --> 00:11:52,880
is not something we can handle.

214
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,560
This beast is called Xu.

215
00:11:56,170 --> 00:11:58,040
This Xu is considered a minor destructive beast.

216
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,840
It is born from devouring the earth

217
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,920
Xu

218
00:12:00,490 --> 00:12:01,880
and lives by feeding off Yin energy.

219
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,960
Even during ancient times,

220
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,120
the ancient cultivators

221
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:08,130
would need many people

222
00:12:08,330 --> 00:12:09,480
to defeat it.

223
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,560
Brother Ceng is really knowledgeable,

224
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,800
I admire you.

225
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,880
Who knows if what he said is real ?

226
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,680
Don't make up a random name.

227
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,120
Ignorant.

228
00:12:19,450 --> 00:12:20,080
You !

229
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,640
This beast only spreads its tentacles

230
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:25,120
when it's looking for food.

231
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,840
When this beast hunts,

232
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,960
it spreads out a red aura.

233
00:12:30,450 --> 00:12:31,960
It's not something we can resist.

234
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,440
Brother Hu,

235
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,600
quickly fly north !

236
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,560
But...

237
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,240
if we got further north,

238
00:12:40,330 --> 00:12:42,160
we will be even more lost in the void.

239
00:12:42,890 --> 00:12:44,320
I don't believe him,

240
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:46,600
if we continue north here,

241
00:12:47,210 --> 00:12:49,560
our future will be uncertain.

242
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,120
It's pointless to talk about this !

243
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,680
Brother Ceng !

244
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:55,920
It's fine that he left.

245
00:12:56,170 --> 00:12:57,160
I don't believe

246
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,120
that he recognized that creature.

247
00:13:01,290 --> 00:13:03,160
Brother Ceng was right...

248
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,800
Had I listened to Brother Ceng,

249
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:10,320
this wouldn't have happened.

250
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:12,720
Go faster !

251
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,200
Red Butterfly, do something !

252
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:54,880
Red Butterfly !

253
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,240
The lost petals

254
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,360
can be recovered via cultivation.

255
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:17,160
But I only have 5 stamens...

256
00:14:17,610 --> 00:14:19,520
I will never be able to get it back !

257
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,760
Brother Ceng,

258
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,600
sit down so we can talk.

259
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,320
Brother Ceng,

260
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,760
I know I was wrong before,

261
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,800
I apologize for my mistake.

262
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,240
Is there anything else the beast will do ?

263
00:14:41,930 --> 00:14:44,480
How can we choose our direction after this ?

264
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:46,780
Since we've escaped the red aura,

265
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:49,040
there shouldn’t be any issues for now.

266
00:14:49,370 --> 00:14:51,000
Brother Chi Hu should follow the map

267
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,840
and try to get back on track.

268
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,640
Okay.

269
00:14:58,400 --> 00:14:59,840
The star compass has been damaged...

270
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:02,080
It won't last long in this condition.

271
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,000
We need to speed up.

272
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,680
From now on,

273
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,200
I need to completely rely on him.

274
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:22,360
10 days later

275
00:15:27,290 --> 00:15:29,400
We've been through a lot in the past 10 days.

276
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,360
Thank you, Brother Ceng.

277
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,000
You're welcome.

278
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,840
I have also gained a lot from

279
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,760
our discussions about the Dao.

280
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:40,960
The Giant Demon Clan isn't native to planet Suzaku.

281
00:15:41,290 --> 00:15:42,360
My ancestors moved there

282
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,840
thousands of years ago.

283
00:15:43,990 --> 00:15:46,240
It's natural that our techniques

284
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:47,840
are somewhat different.

285
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:49,680
That's...

286
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:50,960
Golden Purple Stone

287
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,000
Brother Chi Hu,

288
00:15:52,290 --> 00:15:53,200
please wait a moment.

289
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:57,200
This stone is used to refine star compasses.

290
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,040
In order to leave planet Suzaku,

291
00:15:59,410 --> 00:16:01,160
I will need my own star compass.

292
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:17,040
Void near the first layer of\Nthe overlapping fragments\NRain Celestial Realm

293
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:21,360
We were waiting on the star compass for you to come back

294
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,000
but it began to shake violently

295
00:16:23,450 --> 00:16:26,120
and a strong force threw us off of it.

296
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:27,800
In Tu Si's memory,

297
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:29,760
I have a way to repair it.

298
00:16:29,850 --> 00:16:31,440
The star compass is badly damaged,

299
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:32,360
it's unusable.

300
00:16:32,610 --> 00:16:34,280
It cannot help us fly anymore.

301
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:38,160
The three of us will have to rely on ourselves.

302
00:16:38,410 --> 00:16:39,440
In 3 days,

303
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,200
we should arrive at the fragment.

304
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:49,400
I feel like we are being followed.

305
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:56,360
3 days later

306
00:16:59,180 --> 00:16:59,880
This is it,

307
00:17:00,010 --> 00:17:01,040
this is the place.

308
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:04,080
Xi Zu once described the first layer to me.

309
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:05,840
Brother Chi Hu,

310
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,760
since the location on the jade

311
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:09,840
seems to be on another layer,

312
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:11,840
which layer is it on ?

313
00:17:12,330 --> 00:17:13,120
Useless question.

314
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,680
Of course it's on the second layer.

315
00:17:15,490 --> 00:17:18,880
It is already very unlikely for fragments to overlap once.

316
00:17:19,890 --> 00:17:20,800
Ignorant.

317
00:17:22,930 --> 00:17:23,640
Brother Ceng,

318
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,920
it's on the second layer.

319
00:17:25,610 --> 00:17:27,520
But my ancestor Xi Zu once speculated

320
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:30,280
that there might be a third layer below.

321
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:34,760
Let's move, follow me.

322
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:45,360
Ting'er,

323
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,240
don't worry.

324
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,720
There must be more celestial jades on the third layer.

325
00:18:05,730 --> 00:18:06,280
This...

326
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:09,160
Second layer of the\Noverlapping fragments\NRain Celestial Realm

327
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:11,800
Was Xi Zu mistaken ?

328
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,640
Where are the coffin and the celestial swords ?

329
00:18:15,210 --> 00:18:16,720
How could they have vanished ?

330
00:18:17,610 --> 00:18:19,320
Is this the place you were talking about ?!

331
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,660
If you don’t give me a proper explanation,

332
00:18:21,690 --> 00:18:22,960
I won't let this go !

333
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,240
Chi Hu doesn't seem to be lying.

334
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,840
Something's wrong here.

335
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:32,520
Instead of arguing, why don't

336
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,160
we do something ?

337
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,680
You two,

338
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,200
I was too reckless.

339
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,080
I didn't expect that...

340
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,210
You were reckless ?

341
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,960
Will saying that help me recover my lost stamen !?

342
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:45,480
If you don't explain yourself,

343
00:18:45,970 --> 00:18:48,800
then don’t blame me for not caring about our clans’ relationship.

344
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,040
Once we return to planet Suzaku,

345
00:18:51,370 --> 00:18:52,760
I'll give you a proper explanation.

346
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:55,480
I, Chi Hu, am the young master of the Giant Demon Clan.

347
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:57,440
Although I can’t match you,

348
00:18:57,930 --> 00:18:59,800
I’m a man of my word.

349
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:01,280
Brother Chi Hu,

350
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:03,760
you said before that there might be a third layer.

351
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,920
I think that...

352
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,560
I have found the entrance.

353
00:19:25,010 --> 00:19:27,320
Five Elements Sect's Zhou Yi ?!

354
00:19:46,670 --> 00:19:53,350
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.

355
00:19:53,420 --> 00:19:59,510
Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.

356
00:19:59,620 --> 00:20:03,450
Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls

357
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:07,380
and like many other unseparable things.

358
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:13,390
In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

359
00:20:14,570 --> 00:20:20,400
Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

360
00:20:20,710 --> 00:20:26,250
Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.

361
00:20:26,710 --> 00:20:30,930
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul

362
00:20:31,190 --> 00:20:34,420
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

363
00:20:34,590 --> 00:20:40,410
Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.

364
00:20:40,930 --> 00:20:44,610
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

365
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:48,530
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

366
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:54,380
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

367
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:58,310
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

368
00:20:58,520 --> 00:21:02,090
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

369
00:21:02,210 --> 00:21:08,130
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

370
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:12,210
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

371
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:16,030
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

372
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:21,860
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

373
00:21:21,930 --> 00:21:25,810
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

374
00:21:25,850 --> 00:21:29,650
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

375
00:21:29,950 --> 00:21:35,510
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

376
00:21:36,150 --> 00:21:42,370
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.

377
00:21:42,670 --> 00:21:49,170
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.

378
00:21:50,190 --> 00:21:55,890
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

379
00:21:56,060 --> 00:22:02,760
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
